{"recordedAt":"2026-11-14T08:47:48.830Z","song":{"artist":"Los Ángeles Azules & Natalia Lafourcade","title":"Nunca Es Suficiente","album":"Esto Sí Es Cumbia","itunesGenre":"Música tropical","durationSec":266},"answers":{"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/api.php?format=json&formatversion=2&origin=*&action=query&redirects=1&prop=pageprops%7Crevisions&ppprop=disambiguation%7Cwikibase_item&rvprop=content&rvslots=main&rvsection=0&titles=Nunca+Es+Suficiente+%28Los+%C3%81ngeles+Azules+song%29%7CNunca+Es+Suficiente+%28Los+%C3%81ngeles+Azules+%26+Natalia+Lafourcade+song%29%7CNunca+Es+Suficiente+%28song%29%7CNunca+Es+Suficiente":{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"ns":0,"title":"Nunca Es Suficiente (song)","missing":true},{"ns":0,"title":"Nunca Es Suficiente (Los Ángeles Azules & Natalia Lafourcade song)","missing":true},{"ns":0,"title":"Nunca Es Suficiente (Los Ángeles Azules song)","missing":true},{"pageid":65007510,"ns":0,"title":"Nunca Es Suficiente","pageprops":{"wikibase_item":"Q21003391"},"revisions":[{"slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","content":"{{Short description|2015 single by Natalia Lafourcade}}\n{{Infobox song\n| name       = Nunca Es Suficiente\n| cover      = Nunca es Suficiente - Single.jpg\n| alt        = A sepia-toned picture depicting a woman wearing a white shirt looking down to her right.\n| type       = single\n| artist     = [[Natalia Lafourcade]]\n| album      = [[Hasta la Raíz]]\n| released   = {{Start date|2015|02|10}}\n| recorded   = \n| studio     = * The Underground Studio at Hotel El Ganzo ([[Los Cabos Municipality|Los Cabos]])\n* [[Sonic Ranch]] ([[El Paso]])\n| venue      =\n| genre      = <!-- Please source genres. Genres sources under Critical reception. -->[[Latin pop]]<ref name=HLR-AllMusic>{{cite web|title=Natalia Lafourcade – Hasta la Raíz|url=http://www.allmusic.com/album/hasta-la-raiz-mw0002834083|website=AllMusic|publisher=All Media Network|access-date=January 19, 2016}}</ref>\n| length     = {{Duration|m=3|s=57}}\n| label      =\n*[[Sony Music Entertainment|Sony Mexico]]\n*[[RCA Records|RCA]]\n| writer     =\n* [[María Daniela y su Sonido Lasser|Daniela Azpiazu]]\n* [[Natalia Lafourcade]]\n* Anthony López \n| producer   =\n* Natalia Lafourcade\n*[[Cachorro López]]\n| prev_title = [[Hasta la Raíz (song)|Hasta la Raíz]]\n| prev_year  = 2015\n| next_title = Lo Que Construimos\n| next_year  = 2015\n| misc       = {{External music video|{{YouTube|410cZw2YI0g|\"Nunca Es Suficiente\"}}}}\n}}\n\"'''Nunca Es Suficiente'''\" ({{Translation|\"It's Never Enough\"}}) is a song by Mexican singer-songwriter [[Natalia Lafourcade]] from her fifth studio album ''[[Hasta la Raíz]]'' (2015). The song was released on February 10, 2015, by [[Sony Music Entertainment|Sony Music México]] as the second single from the album. It was written by Lafourcade alongside [[María Daniela y su Sonido Lasser|Daniela Azpiazu]], Anthony López and was produced with Argentine producer [[Cachorro López]], who also produced many of the songs from the album.\n\n\"Nunca Es Suficiente\" was met with positive reviews from music critics. It garnered commercial success, being one of her most commercially successful songs alongside \"[[Hasta la Raíz (song)|Hasta la Raíz]]\". A [[Mexican cumbia|cumbia]] version of the song was released in 2018 with Mexican group [[Los Ángeles Azules]], to great commercial success. The version won Regional Mexican Song of the Year at the [[2020 Billboard Latin Music Awards|2020 ''Billboard'' Latin Music Awards]]."}}}]}]}},"https://itunes.apple.com/search?term=Los+%C3%81ngeles+Azules+%26+Natalia+Lafourcade+Nunca+Es+Suficiente&entity=song&limit=25":{"results":[{"wrapperType":"track","artistName":"Los Ángeles Azules","trackName":"Nunca Es Suficiente (feat. Natalia Lafourcade)","collectionName":"Nunca Es Suficiente (feat. Natalia Lafourcade) - Single","primaryGenreName":"Música tropical","trackTimeMillis":266213,"artistId":3500477,"collectionId":1803244940},{"wrapperType":"tra